<i>Hayden. Hayden.</i>

1280
01:15:39,508 --> 01:15:42,576
[BIRDS SINGING IN BACKGROUND]

1281
01:15:48,082 --> 01:15:51,018
[WATER LAPPING]

1282
01:16:06,233 --> 01:16:09,136
[BIRDS SINGING IN BACKGROUND]

1283
01:16:09,203 --> 01:16:15,976
[♪♪♪]

1284
01:16:24,553 --> 01:16:27,688
[BLOOD PLOPPING]

1285
01:16:30,724 --> 01:16:34,895
[♪♪♪]

1286
01:16:49,376 --> 01:16:51,645
[WATER RIPPLING]

1287
01:16:54,448 --> 01:16:57,051
[GUN HAMMER CLICKS]

1288
01:16:57,118 --> 01:17:04,091
[♪♪♪]

1289
01:17:07,128 --> 01:17:08,796
Hello, Sam.

1290
01:17:12,567 --> 01:17:15,236
Like seein' a ghost? I know.

1291
01:17:17,539 --> 01:17:19,206
You're not real.

1292
01:17:22,409 --> 01:17:24,078
Of course I am.

1293
01:17:27,081 --> 01:17:28,849
Mm-mm-mm-mm.

1294
01:17:31,018 --> 01:17:31,719
How?

1295
01:17:31,785 --> 01:17:34,523
Augustus used me to recruit you.

1296
01:17:34,589 --> 01:17:37,691
He knew we would hit it off,
as they say.

1297
01:17:37,758 --> 01:17:39,026
After all, with what happened
with your parents,

1298
01:17:39,093 --> 01:17:41,395
you were the perfect candidate
for training.

1299
01:17:41,462 --> 01:17:42,897
I killed you.

1300
01:17:42,963 --> 01:17:44,533
[LAUGHS]

1301
01:17:44,599 --> 01:17:46,467
Sam, please.

1302
01:17:46,535 --> 01:17:48,435
You couldn't even do that right.

1303
01:17:49,203 --> 01:17:50,971
You missed my heart.

1304
01:17:52,273 --> 01:17:53,374
[GUNSHOT]

1305
01:17:53,440 --> 01:17:54,708
[BODY THUDS]

1306
01:17:55,176 --> 01:17:57,878
[COUGHS]

1307
01:17:59,180 --> 01:18:03,117
Nona, for the last six years,
I've been talking to your ghost.

1308
01:18:04,985 --> 01:18:07,054
Sounds like you need
a shrink to me.

1309
01:18:07,788 --> 01:18:10,625
You shot the woman you loved.

1310
01:18:10,691 --> 01:18:14,195
I was never okay with it. Never.

1311
01:18:14,629 --> 01:18:18,866
Pathetico.
Where's Managold, Sam?

1312
01:18:21,168 --> 01:18:22,269
Dead.

1313
01:18:23,470 --> 01:18:24,939
Come on, Sam.

1314
01:18:25,005 --> 01:18:28,643
We had some
good times together, didn't we?

1315
01:18:28,709 --> 01:18:30,679
You can tell me the truth.

1316
01:18:30,744 --> 01:18:32,313
I am telling you the truth.

1317
01:18:33,480 --> 01:18:35,082
Liar.

1318
01:18:40,522 --> 01:18:42,122
It's fitting, you killing me.

1319
01:18:43,857 --> 01:18:45,960
It's how it's supposed to be.

1320
01:18:47,027 --> 01:18:49,763
At least you get to die
at your lake, right?

1321
01:18:50,599 --> 01:18:53,067
That's what you always wanted.

1322
01:18:58,439 --> 01:18:59,406
-[BULLET ZINGS]
-[GUNSHOT]

1323
01:18:59,473 --> 01:19:02,243
[BODY THUDS]

1324
01:19:03,911 --> 01:19:07,081
[BIRDS SINGING IN BACKGROUND]

1325
01:19:09,416 --> 01:19:16,190
[♪♪♪]

1326
01:19:24,431 --> 01:19:31,205
[♪♪♪]

1327
01:19:39,446 --> 01:19:46,220
[♪♪♪]

1328
01:19:54,461 --> 01:20:01,235
[♪♪♪]

1329
01:20:09,476 --> 01:20:16,250
[♪♪♪]

1330
01:20:25,794 --> 01:20:29,129
[PHONE RINGING]

1331
01:20:30,431 --> 01:20:32,734
Racing's finished for the day
if you were plannin'

1332
01:20:32,801 --> 01:20:34,435
on making any bets.

1333
01:20:34,501 --> 01:20:35,737
[CHARLES ON PHONE]
<i>That's your line of work,</i>

1334
01:20:35,804 --> 01:20:36,604
<i>not mine.</i>

1335
01:20:37,438 --> 01:20:40,742
I'm always happy to hear it
from my best asset.

1336
01:20:40,809 --> 01:20:42,610
CHARLES: [ON PHONE]
<i>I'm not yours anymore.</i>

1337
01:20:42,677 --> 01:20:44,579
Come on. Come on in.

1338
01:20:44,646 --> 01:20:45,979
Let's talk about this.

1339
01:20:46,046 --> 01:20:48,750
I have one more job for you,
and then we're even.

1340
01:20:48,817 --> 01:20:49,917
You've got my word.

1341
01:20:49,983 --> 01:20:51,051
CHARLES: [ON PHONE]
<i>Your word?</i>

1342
01:20:51,118 --> 01:20:54,021
Managold, you know
my word's always good.

1343
01:20:54,088 --> 01:20:56,591
CHARLES: [ON PHONE]
<i>Yeah, I guess.</i>

1344
01:20:56,658 --> 01:20:57,891
It's a special job.

1345
01:20:57,958 --> 01:20:59,159
CHARLES: [ON PHONE]
<i>Hayden.</i>

1346
01:20:59,226 --> 01:21:01,596
<i>You want me to kill the man</i>
<i>who let me live?</i>

1347
01:21:01,663 --> 01:21:03,798
The man that failed to kill you?
Yes!

1348
01:21:03,864 --> 01:21:05,667
And think about it.

1349
01:21:05,734 --> 01:21:07,134
The legend
comes out of retirement

1350
01:21:07,201 --> 01:21:11,071
to take down
the killer of all killers.

1351
01:21:11,138 --> 01:21:13,742
You do this,
and I'll make sure you

1352
01:21:13,808 --> 01:21:15,442
and your family are good
from now on.

1353
01:21:15,510 --> 01:21:17,478
[CHARLES ON PHONE]
I <i>nteresting offer, but,</i>

1354
01:21:17,545 --> 01:21:19,947
<i>I called to say goodbye.</i>

1355
01:21:20,013 --> 01:21:21,716
Let's think about this
for a second.

1356
01:21:21,783 --> 01:21:22,883
[CHARLES ON PHONE]
<i>I've been doin'</i>

1357
01:21:22,950 --> 01:21:24,351
<i>a lot of thinkin'.</i>

1358
01:21:26,654 --> 01:21:27,822
You know what happens next.

1359
01:21:27,888 --> 01:21:31,258
CHARLES: [ON PHONE]
<i>I do. Goodbye, Augustus.</i>

1360
01:21:35,697 --> 01:21:37,231
[SIGHS]

1361
01:21:42,604 --> 01:21:43,805
[BANG]

1362
01:21:43,872 --> 01:21:47,107
[PHONE RINGS]

1363
01:21:48,409 --> 01:21:49,476
Hello?

1364
01:21:49,544 --> 01:21:52,179
[SAM ON PHONE] <i>You</i>
<i>have somethin' on your shirt.</i>

1365
01:21:52,246 --> 01:21:53,681
Excuse me?

1366
01:21:53,748 --> 01:21:55,315
You should have bet
on a sure thing.

1367
01:21:55,382 --> 01:21:56,651
Oh, fuck.

1368
01:21:56,718 --> 01:21:58,385
[GUNSHOT]

1369
01:22:04,057 --> 01:22:07,361
[CAR DOOR OPENS AND SHUTS]

1370
01:22:07,428 --> 01:22:14,401
[♪♪♪]

1371
01:22:17,906 --> 01:22:21,241
[CAR ENGINE STARTS]

1372
01:22:21,308 --> 01:22:24,411
[CAR WHIRS]

1373
01:22:26,413 --> 01:22:28,650
SAM: <i>Remember when I said</i>
<i>you can't have friends</i>

1374
01:22:28,716 --> 01:22:30,718
<i>in this business?</i>

1375
01:22:30,785 --> 01:22:34,054
<i>Turns out it's all bullshit.</i>

1376
01:22:35,122 --> 01:22:39,059
<i>In this world,</i>
<i>you need friends.</i>

1377
01:22:40,060 --> 01:22:46,266
[♪♪♪]

1378
01:22:53,942 --> 01:22:58,178
[♪♪♪]

1379
01:23:08,957 --> 01:23:14,194
[♪♪♪]

1380
01:23:23,972 --> 01:23:29,777
[♪♪♪]

1381
01:23:38,987 --> 01:23:44,759
[♪♪♪]

1382
01:23:54,002 --> 01:24:00,173
[♪♪♪]

1383
01:24:09,017 --> 01:24:14,454
[♪♪♪]